#==============================================================================================
#
#   font_face_1 - CSS::FontFace: creating font faces, from script or from an @font-face rule
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/FontFace.cpp (lines 1-408) and the inline members of FontFace.h
#       (lines 20-171): the descriptor computations, load_vector_font, the FontFace
#       constructor (its BinaryData branch with the asynchronous parse), CSS-connected faces,
#       the ParsedFontFace of a face, visiting, the status promise, the font computer of the
#       face's sets and the fonts of a face at a size. A FontFace holds a promise, a JS object:
#       creating one traps in WebIDL::create_promise until phase 3.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2024, Andrew Kaster <akaster@serenityos.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2025-2026, Sam Atkins <sam@ladybird.org>
#       SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
#
#==============================================================================================

